      "writtenOn": "2022-05-31T22:58:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I verified that the latest patch fixes the issue. Patch LGTM.\n\nWhy did you use timer to detect the bad state instead of directly detecting the bad state when it happens?",
      "parentUuid": "0cb03edf_f6397a6c",
      "revId": "957f88c9eb058c8b941b6224e57753bc757fdef5",
